183
00:17:46,830 --> 00:17:51,510
From a backlog perspective, usually the backlog is prioritized based on a feature priority.

184
00:17:51,510 --> 00:18:01,030
Does that still continue or is there a risk ranked backlog which needs to be considered when you have a risk-first approach?

185
00:18:01,030 --> 00:18:03,710
So, I would challenge what is the feature priority?

186
00:18:03,720 --> 00:18:07,510
How do you arrive at the priority of the feature?

